{"slug": "geoffrey-strickland", "title": "Geoffrey Strickland", "modified": "2024-10-18", "kind": "person", "img": "data:image/webp;base64,", "role": "", "name": "Geoffrey Bedford Strickland", "html": "<p>Geoffrey Strickland, JD, JCL, LLM, is an international lawyer focusing on dispute settlement and human rights advocacy. He served the Holy See for over 10 years as a legal analyst with the Pontifical Council for the Family, as facilitator of the Forum of Catholic-inspired Non-governmental Organizations and as a translator for various Vatican offices. His research interests include the nexus of law, language and interpretation, as well as human rights synergies in civil society.</p>", "text": "Geoffrey Bedford Strickland Geoffrey Strickland, JD, JCL, LLM, is an international lawyer focusing on dispute settlement and human rights advocacy. He served the Holy See for over 10 years as a legal analyst with the Pontifical Council for the Family, as facilitator of the Forum of Catholic-inspired Non-governmental Organizations and as a translator for various Vatican offices. His research intere"}